<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Halo\'92s training kicked in immediately. Even in shock, he pressed the panic button clipped to his belt, and fossicked in his pocket for an object he hoped he would never need.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>His vision became blurry and short-sighted. Unrecognisable shadows and shapes moved overhead. Tony\'92s face loomed large, as if he was closer than his own nose.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Halo!\'92 Tony cried. \'91Stay with me. You\'92re okay. Stay with me.\'92 Tony grasped Halo\'92s hand and held it tight. And felt the object it held.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Halo nodded. \'91It\'92s for you,\'92 he whispered with great labour. \'91It\'92s time you knew.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Tony\'92s brain stepped up to its full wattage and he knew the thumb drive contained secrets meant only for him.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91I\'92m sorry.\'92 Halo\'92s words came slow and with great effort. \'91I can\'92t protect you anymore.\'92 He fell limp and lifeless. His breath left him.\
